# Org-pack resolution (every chat)

`COMPANY-*.md` resolves from `context/org-pack.local/` (real, gitignored)
first, else `context/org-pack/` (the public fictional example). The
`Org pack:` line of `npm run -s harness:context` says which. Never mix
them. A partial local pack → flag the gap and ask. No local pack is normal.
Never hardcode a company in engine files. Never write real company facts
into `context/org-pack/`. Full rules, extra files included:
`harness/references/session-start.md` § Org pack.
